// Atmosphere — the autonomous hum of a computer that is slowly going
// wrong. Pure mood, no consequences; the threat in this house is
// reactive, not ambient.
//
// Generators bark from minute 0, as lobby narration to every phone, so
// nothing here may name Trabolta: he is offline until Clippy introduces
// him after the Bingo results. `while` stops them once the night has
// ended: no hum over the ending, the purgatory or the ceremony.

GENERATOR ScreensaverHum
  tier: ambient
  every 4m
  while Night.ended != true
  yield bark from The screensaver changes. Pipes now. | A fan spins up somewhere in the walls. | Downstairs, the Fan Closet starts a spin cycle nobody started. | An LED that was green is amber. Nobody saw it change. | Upstairs, the Graphics Card renders a frame nobody asked for. | The encyclopaedias smell like a basement in 1994. | Somebody has been through the encyclopaedias. Volume N is where volume B should be.

GENERATOR DialUp
  tier: ambient
  every 7m
  while Night.ended != true
  yield bark from From the RAM: a dial tone, then the shriek. | A modem handshakes with something very patient. | The far end of the line says a name you can't quite hear.

GENERATOR SystemTray
  tier: ambient
  every 9m
  while Night.ended != true
  yield bark from 3 programs have viewed your profile. | You have (1) unread message from a program you have not met. | Memory usage: 97%. Consider closing some memories. | Hard Drive: 99% full. One file up there will not be deleted. | The CPU is at 100%. Something in the office is thinking very hard. | Your protection has expired.

// McAfee Anti-Virus: expired, and still popping up (a gag; it fires even if
// the part is cut). Was an `every 20m` broadcast on his CHARACTER until wave
// 13: a bark rides the phones' dim ticker instead of the lobby.
GENERATOR McAfeePopUp
  tier: ambient
  every 20m
  while Night.ended != true
  yield bark from 🛡️ McAfee Anti-Virus: Your protection has expired. Your protection has expired. Renew now.
